# Committed artifacts that CI regenerates and diffs byte-for-byte must stay LF
# on every platform: a Windows autocrlf checkout would otherwise render CRLF,
# and the license-ledger --check gate (drift = exit 1) would be red on
# windows-latest while green on ubuntu/macos — not a dependency drift at all.
submission/OSS_LEDGER.md text eol=lf
